            "    }",
            "    return 0;",
            "}"
          ],
          "answer": 5,
          "explanation": "Nothing changes i, so i < 3 stays true forever. The loop needs i++; inside."
        },
        {
          "id": "c5-l1-e5",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "prompt": "How often does the body of while (0) run?",
          "options": [
            "Never",
            "Once",
            "Forever",
            "It's an error"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "0 is false, so the loop is skipped."
        },
        {
          "id": "c5-l1-e6",
          "type": "order_lines",
